; Brokerage example: costs, an include, prices and assertions.
include invest-prices.journal

2024-03-01 * Fund the broker account
    Assets:Broker:Cash        $5,000.00
    Assets:Bank:Checking

2024-03-04 * Buy shares
    Assets:Broker:Shares      20 AAPL @ $170.25
    Assets:Broker:Cash

2024-03-20 * Sell shares  ; partial
    Assets:Broker:Shares      -5 AAPL @@ $900.00
    Assets:Broker:Cash        $900.00

2024-03-31 * Statement
    Assets:Broker:Cash        $0.00 = $2,495.00
    Assets:Broker:Shares      0 AAPL = 15 AAPL
